~ start
PuzzleMaster: Greetings.
PuzzleMaster: I am the guardian of Eve. To be allowed an audience with her you must first get through me.
PuzzleMaster: ...
PuzzleMaster: What about the chests you might be thinking? One of these contains something you need for your journey.
PuzzleMaster: The others... Well... They contain your [wave]death.[/wave]
PuzzleMaster: Go ahead and choose a chest. Choose Wisely.

- The Chest on the left.
	do SelectChest("Left")
	PuzzleMaster: So you have chosen the Left chest. 
- The Chest in the middle.
	do SelectChest("Middle")
	PuzzleMaster: So you have chosen the Middle chest. 
- The Chest on the right.
	do SelectChest("Right")
	PuzzleMaster: So you have chosen the Right chest. 

PuzzleMaster: Wait! Do not open it yet.
PuzzleMaster: I will let you make another choice, but first, let me open this one.

do OpenUnselectedChestMimic()

PuzzleMaster: Will you change your decision?
- Change your decision.
	do SelectNewChest(true)

	if _chosenChest.IsMimic
		PuzzleMaster: Hmm... You were unlucky this time.
		
	else:
		PuzzleMaster: You have made the correct choice. Good luck, traveller.
		

- Stick with your decision.
	do SelectNewChest(false)
	
	if _chosenChest.IsMimic
		PuzzleMaster: Haha! Wrong choice!
	else:
		PuzzleMaster: You got lucky!
		
do EndGame()
=> END